# Undercover Skrull: "As long as there are two or more creature cards in your graveyard, this creature gets +2/+2 and is all creature types.
# {T}: Add one mana of any color." Faithless Looting discards one Grizzly Bears and a Forest on turn 1: one creature card, one short, so the
# Skrull is a 1/1 of its own types alone. On turn 3 the Skrull taps for {R}, which with two Moxen pays Looting's flashback, discarding a
# second Grizzly Bears: two creature cards, so it is a 3/3 and every creature type (a Human, say, and a Zombie).

